00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:54.750
How is it that mothers can give birth to children?

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:59.349
How is it that one form, that’s complex
and attractive and mysterious, can give rise

00:07:59.349 --> 00:08:00.850
