00:16:25.649 --> 00:16:26.649
there.

00:16:26.649 --> 00:16:30.180
His friend said John why don’t you come
along with me.

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:34.800
I've just opened a new business and I could
really use some help, come along quick.

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:37.100
It will be opening soon.

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:38.499
John thought that sounded good.

00:16:38.499 --> 00:16:40.319
But his friend was in a hurry.

00:16:40.319 --> 00:16:42.939
Besides couldn't he see the ruby?

00:16:42.939 --> 00:16:47.149
How could he speed along beside him where
would he put his jewel.

00:16:47.149 --> 00:16:49.240
So he said thanks but I have to take care
of my jewel.

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:51.199
Maybe I’ll see you later.

00:16:51.199 --> 00:16:55.279
His friend looked at him like he was crazy
but he was trying to get somewhere quick so

00:16:55.279 --> 00:16:59.060
he just shrugged a bit and said okay John
see you later.

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:01.230
And he sped on down the road.

00:17:01.230 --> 00:17:04.660
Little while later another friend came by
and he said John nice to see you.

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:05.809
I'm going back to school.

00:17:05.809 --> 00:17:09.750
There are lots of wonderful things to learn,
great things to do.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:11.800
The world is full of unsolved problems.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.490
I could use some company.

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:15.640
Would you like to come along.

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:19.620
John thought that sounded pretty good but
this friend too looked like he was in a hurry.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:23.160
Besides standing beside the road holding the
jewel was tiring and he needed all the energy

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:24.660
he had for that.

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:28.700
So he said to his friend thanks but I have
to take care of my jewel.

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:31.870
Isn't it beautiful maybe I’ll see you later.

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:35.660
His friend looked at him like he was crazy
but he was trying to get somewhere quick so

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:42.340
he just shrugged and said hope everything
goes all right with you, see you later.

00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:44.840
Many friends came and went and the years went
by.

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:47.200
The jewel got heavier and heavier.

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:49.300
But the man got more and more attached to
it.

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:53.140
The only thing was nobody seemed to notice
how beautiful it was.

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:57.770
People would rush by and talk about their
plans and nobody had a ruby as big and nobody

00:17:57.770 --> 00:18:03.100
seemed likely to get a ruby as big if you'd
think that someone might have said something

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:09.990
like at least nice ruby John sure wish I had
one like that but it never happened.

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:14.000
Then one day someone new came down the road,
he was bent over and he was thin and his hair

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.460
was gray, although he didn't look that old.

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:21.620
He was carrying a big dirty rock carefully
in his arms and he wasn’t making much progress.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:26.539
The strange figure approached and glanced
up at John, then he grinned and said, why

00:18:26.539 --> 00:18:30.990
are you standing there so stupidly with a
big ugly rock in your tired old hands.

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:32.150
You look pretty daft.

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:37.059
I bet you wish you had a big ruby like the
one I'm carrying and John thought this poor

00:18:37.059 --> 00:18:40.540
man is deluded, he’s carrying a rock.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:44.520
I have the ruby so he said excuse me sir but
you were sadly mistaken.

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:48.860
I'm the one with the jewel I met a little
gnome by the side of the road and he sold

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:49.860
it to me.

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:52.530
I’m still paying for it.

00:18:52.530 --> 00:18:56.550
Although not so very much, you are carrying
a rock.

00:18:56.550 --> 00:19:00.480
The tired stranger looked annoyed said I don't
know what game you're playing mister you have

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:03.220
a rock I have a jewel.

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:05.340
Little gnome you described sold it to me.

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:06.960
And he said it was the only one.

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:09.750
I've been carrying it for 20 years.

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:11.870
And I’ll never let it go.

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:16.870
And John said but I'm been carrying mine for
20 years too, it can’t be just a rock.

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:19.920
Rock or jewel on and on they argued.

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:22.809
Suddenly out stepped the little gnome as if
he’d never left.

00:19:22.809 --> 00:19:26.590
Only this time he wasn’t so little he was
bigger and redder and menacing and his laugh

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:29.730
sounded like the rattling of chains.

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:31.470
Quit arguing you two.

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:34.080
I've never seen a sight quite so pathetic.

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:36.880
You're carrying rocks, both of you.

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:41.000
And if you would've ever had the sense to
put them down for a second or two you would've

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:42.210
seen that.

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:44.700
Oh well at least you were diligent.

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:46.529
I played a mean trick.

00:19:46.529 --> 00:19:48.559
I feel bad.

00:19:48.559 --> 00:19:51.190
So I'm gonna give you what you really deserve.

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:54.950
Do you want what you really deserve?

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:59.370
And John and the thin stranger nodded eagerly,
finally they thought.

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:01.610
You haven't seen anything yet.

00:20:01.610 --> 00:20:03.460
Throw down your rocks.

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:05.929
So John and the thin stranger obeyed.

00:20:05.929 --> 00:20:10.899
Each rock split down the middle and it hit
the ground, out flowed a river of ravenous

00:20:10.899 --> 00:20:15.870
white worms which rushed towards the men and
devoured them whole while they thrashed about

00:20:15.870 --> 00:20:18.190
and screamed.

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:22.480
