drum.

00:20:28.779 --> 00:20:30.899
He drummed and he waited.

00:20:30.899 --> 00:20:34.860
And he hummed an odd little tune.

00:20:34.860 --> 00:20:40.890
Picture of food feeds the whole hungry clan,
the image of good makes the whole healthy

00:20:40.890 --> 00:20:50.519
man, why walk for miles why do the work, just
smile the smile, success after all is a quirk,

00:20:50.519 --> 00:20:53.320
life isn't real that’s the message I give.

00:20:53.320 --> 00:21:03.550
It’s easy that way, plus who wants to live?

